00:22:20,521 --> 00:22:33,320
Rym: But then at the end of the first episode, the shogun, she basically goes to the oldest guy she knows and is like, "I want to see the records that are secret that only I'm allowed to

300
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:33,480
