Scott: GeekNights is recorded live with no studio and no audience.

481
00:37:00,672 --> 00:37:04,140
Scott: But unlike those other late shows, it's actually recorded at night.

482
00:37:04,620 --> 00:37:20,620
Rym: And your picture on Patrons for this July 3rd episode of the GeekNights Podcast are Alan Joyce, Link Pidgeon, Miller, The Tenderberry, Casey Tare, Mix of Music, Chris The Dot, Chris Ford, Clinton Walton, Finn, Joel Hayes, Penny Rymer, Rebecca Dunn, Sam Erickson, Shervin Von Hurl, and a bunch of people who do not want me to say their names.

483
00:37:21,181 --> 00:37:27,656
Rym: Tonight, on this 4th of July Eve, I leave you with...

